  "body": "## What\n\n- The converter maps a Select record with `exactMatch: true` to `session.select@1` and every other Select record to `session.legacySelect@1`, `value` unchanged.\n- A V2 Select record with a `legacyTarget` selector converts through its recorded `targetId`. Dynamic selector kinds stay unsupported placeholders.\n\n## Why\n\n- The converter rule from the [BE-3483](https://linear.app/sola-ai/issue/BE-3483) decision record, so converted milestone workflows keep the select behavior they were built on.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `exactMatch` is represented because it picks the action. The select-matching warning is gone.\n- The legacy runner picks its own path from a run-time team flag the converter cannot read, so `exactMatch` stands in as the author's intent.\n- No upgrade from `legacySelect` to `select`: recorded options can be as stale as the stored value, so a safe upgrade cannot be told from a broken one.\n- PickFromList stays a placeholder.\n\n## Examples\n\nFerrara's Select record, action `c4fb250f-7322-4b50-a007-bc739dc3f06b` in workflow `d6e07303-729b-4936-bdb2-dce304fd8043`:\n\n```json\n{ \"actionType\": \"Select\", \"id\": \"c4fb250f-7322-4b50-a007-bc739dc3f06b\",\n  \"targetId\": \"8034b95d-35af-4dfe-b10f-806a806316a9\", \"variableId\": \"96815eac-fd95-4829-a514-33d87a154827\", \"exactMatch\": false }\n```\n\nconverts to\n\n```json\n{ \"kind\": \"action\", \"action\": \"session.legacySelect@1\",\n  \"in\": { \"session\": { \"kind\": \"var\", \"id\": \"v_session\" }, \"target\": { \"kind\": \"var\", \"id\": \"8034b95d-35af-4dfe-b10f-806a806316a9\" }, \"value\": { \"kind\": \"lit\", \"value\": \"Manage Documents\" } } }\n```\n\n| Record | Before this layer | After | Same or gap |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Select, `exactMatch: true` | `session.select@1`, warning `select-matching`, `exactMatch` approximated | `session.select@1`, `exactMatch` represented | same action, warning gone |\n| Select, `exactMatch: false` or absent | `session.select@1`, warning `select-matching` | `session.legacySelect@1` | changed: legacy default path kept |\n| Select, `actionVersion: \"2.0\"`, `selector.type: \"legacyTarget\"` | placeholder (unsupported fields) | `session.legacySelect@1` through `targetId` | changed |\n| Select, `actionVersion: \"2.0\"`, `selector.type: \"loopIndexedXPath\"` | placeholder | placeholder | same |\n| PickFromList | placeholder | placeholder | same |\n\n## Testing\n\n- Covered by CI.\n",
